{"synopsis":"Demi efek acaranya, Fang Ning mengundang kru drama murahan untuk mempersiapkan siaran langsung semalaman di Makam Putri. Namun, tanpa diduga, sesuatu terjadi di tengah siaran langsung – Fang Ning mengira hantu wanita adalah aktris dan melamarnya secara langsung! Sekarang, apa yang harus dia lakukan jika dia menganggapnya serius?!","alternative_title":"直播整活，我向女鬼求婚——她居然真答应了？！, Zhibo Zheng Huo, Wo Xiang Nv Gui Qiuhun - Ta Juran Zhen Dayingle?!, During the Live Broadcast, I Proposed to a Female Spirit - And She Said Yes?!, I Proposed to a Ghost Girl During the Livestreaming - And She Actually Agree?!, Tôi Livestream Cầu Hôn Nữ Quỷ Vậy Mà Thành Công!?","author":"Chuangxing Comic Studio (创星漫艺工作室)","artist":"Chuangxing Comic Studio (创星漫艺工作室)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"c5736d3a-64ec-4f72-b65f-9c93c6a2b8b5","number":"105","chapter":"105","title":"","date":"2025-07-07","released":"2025-07-07","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_32b7a093-773c-47dc-9a39-bfee47f66ccb/chapter_ch_105/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_32b7a093-773c-47dc-9a39-bfee47f66ccb/chapter_ch_105/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_32b7a093-773c-47dc-9a39-bfee47f66ccb/chapter_ch_105/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_32b7a093-773c-47dc-9a39-bfee47f66ccb/chapter_ch_105/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_32b7a093-773c-47dc-9a39-bfee47f66ccb/chapter_ch_105/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_32b7a093-773c-47dc-9a39-bfee47f66ccb/chapter_ch_105/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_32b7a093-773c-47dc-9a39-bfee47f66ccb/chapter_ch_105/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_32b7a093-773c-47dc-9a39-bfee47f66ccb/chapter_ch_105/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_32b7a093-773c-47dc-9a39-bfee47f66ccb/chapter_ch_105/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_32b7a093-773c-47dc-9a39-bfee47f66ccb/chapter_ch_105/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_32b7a093-773c-47dc-9a39-bfee47f66ccb/chapter_ch_10